# Video and motion exports ride in Git LFS (docs/assets.md: MP4, WebM and
# GIF, set up before phase 7). Manifests and every other export stay normal
# files. git-lfs is installed and the filter is wired into this repo's git
# config, so committing these files stores LFS pointers; blobs committed as
# plain files before the filter existed stay that way in history.
assets/video/exports/*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/motion/exports/*.webm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/motion/exports/*.gif filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
